      "connectsTo": "https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/550924",
      "details": "<p>Due to the mention of Thyateira in AGRW 135 =\u00a0TAM V 959\u00a0= ILydiaKP II 51\u00a0= ILydiaHoz 22.10\u00a0=\u00a0<a href=\"http://epigraphy.packhum.org/text/264389\" target=\"_blank\">PHI 264389</a>\u00a0= AGRW ID# 693, it is probable that Mernouphyta was located somewhere in the vicinity of\u00a0<span>Thyateira. The Attalids apparently founded<span>\u00a0<span>Mernouphyta either to reinforce or counter the power of\u00a0<span>Thyateira, depending on\u00a0<span>Thyateira's\u00a0</span>relationship to the Seleukid Empire.</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
